OL,3,GNEWSAPM pledges 'serious look' at
OL,4,Aisland ferry fares
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has agreed
OL,7,Fto "look seriously" at a proposal to
OL,8,Fregulate fare prices for cross-Solent
OL,9,Fferries.
OL,11,FSpeaking in the House of Commons, Isle
OL,12,Fof Wight East MP Joe Robertson said
OL,13,Fregulatory measures would "put
OL,14,Fpassengers first".
OL,16,FFerry operators Red Funnel and
OL,17,FWightlink have faced criticism over
OL,18,Freliability of services and the price
OL,19,Fof fares.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
